Package: python3-bless
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-bleak, python3-dbus-next
Description: BLE GATT server library for Python
 Bless (BLE Server State) is a library for creating BLE GATT
 servers using the bleak library for Bluetooth Low Energy.
 .
 It provides a cross-platform API for advertising BLE services
 and handling GATT characteristic read/write requests.
 .
 On Linux it uses the BlueZ D-Bus interface.
 .
 This is the Python 3 version of the package.
